WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.537
Step 5 checks the tenant restrictions.

2
00:00:02.537 --> 00:00:05.063
The default blocks, and tagging is on.

3
00:00:05.063 --> 00:00:09.661
But one partner tenant is allowed with
no register entry, and the block query

4
00:00:09.661 --> 00:00:14.187
shows a tenant that isn't a registered
partner, listed for the weekly review.

5
00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:15.452
Step 6 plans ring 1,

6
00:00:15.452 --> 00:00:20.088
whose desired state wants the
compliant network policy enforced.

7
00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:21.874
Without the enforce switch,

8
00:00:21.874 --> 00:00:25.525
the plan leaves it report-only
and says so on a manual line.

9
00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:30.860
A reviewer passes the switch only once step
3's check is clean, which it isn't yet.
